OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thu 10 Sep to Sat 19 Sep
OL,6,FChangeable initially, with some dry
OL,7,Finterludes and relatively cool nights,
OL,8,Finterspersed with occasional outbreaks
OL,9,Fof rain or showers arriving from the
OL,10,Fwest, perhaps accompanied by some
OL,11,Fstrong winds at times too. A trend
OL,12,Ftoward some longer dry interludes
OL,13,Fbetween systems as we head toward mid-
OL,14,FSeptember, but at this stage a return
OL,15,Fof prolonged dry, settled weather
OL,16,Flooks unlikely. Temperatures will
OL,17,Fprobably be close to average overall,
OL,18,Fthough still with some relatively cool
OL,19,Fnights at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
FL,164,160,301,260,100,100
