OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F163A1788612462
OL,1,Wj5hw1~{4k7juhw1{$             G2/2
OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sat 19 Sep to Sat 3 Oct
OL,6,FHigh pressure initially close to the
OL,7,FUK, with a continuation of more
OL,8,Fsettled conditions at times, may
OL,9,Feventually start to weaken its
OL,10,Finfluence on the weather towards the
OL,11,Fend of September. As a result, it may
OL,12,Fbecome more changeable with a greater
OL,13,Fchance of rain or showers in places,
OL,14,Fand perhaps some strong winds at times
OL,15,Ftoo. Temperatures will likely be a
OL,16,Flittle above average overall, with
OL,17,Frelatively cool nights possible at
OL,18,Ffirst tending to reduce in frequency
OL,19,Flater in the period.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
